  "question": {
    "text": "In an&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>A.C.</mtext></math> circuit, the instantaneous e.m.f. and current are given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>. In one cycle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>A.C.</mtext></math>, the average power consumed by the circuit (in watt) and the watt-less current (in ampere) are, respectively:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>50, 0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>50, 10</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>10</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Instantaneous emf and current is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Phase difference between emf and current is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0152_60225d45a0e2.png\" style=\"width: 178px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>Average power is given by,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>av</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>rms</mi></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>rms</mi></msub><mi>cos&#981;</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><br /><br />Watt-less current is given by,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>WL</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>rms</mi></msub><mi>sin&#981;</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub><mrow><mo>&#8730;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>WL</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>.</p></blockquote>"
  }
